  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently, the \"Looks\" section of the Avatar Main Menu as well as the Action Menu show all the looks that you have created for all of your Avatars.\n\nWhile this is ideal for quickly glancing at your different looks, it can get quite cluttered and unorganised quickly when you have multiple skins.\n\nThe action menu for example will also only show you your first 9 looks.\n\n# Suggestion / Feedback:\n\nThe \"Looks\" section of the Avatar Main Menu as well as the Action Menu should always only show the looks that you have created for the Avatar you are using right now.\n\nThis would make it a lot easier to find your different looks for your current Avatar in these menus and would prevent clutter from when you have too many looks.\n\nTo make this easier to understand for the general audience, you could also rename the \"Looks\" header in the Avatars Main Menu to \"Looks for {Avatar Name}\".",
